    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, butter? I thought I heard somewhere that butter was bad for burns? My grandma always said it traps the heat in. Are you sure that's okay to do? And how much tea tree oil should I actually use? Like, should I just drench the whole thing in it?",
